uld know about next week?\"], [\"Would you mind telling me which important dates fall next week?\"], [\"important dates next week?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w09-074\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me when Stellan Wetherby's birthday is, please?\"], [\"when's stellan wetherby's bday\"], [\"When is Stellan Wetherby's birthday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w09-075\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please find anything to do with Iwasaki?\", \"Would you mind showing only the ones on friday?\", \"On another subject, could you show me my documents about receipt, please?\", \"Which of those are about bike, please?\"], [\"umm can you dig up whatever I've got to do with Iwasaki?\", \"oh and actually just the ones on friday, if that's alright\", \"right, different thing, what documents have I got about receipt stuff?\", \"and which of those are about the bike, would you say?\"], [\"Iwasaki stuff\", \"just friday\", \"receipt docs\", \"bike ones?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w09-076\", \"v\": [[\"Passport stuff\", \"photos only\", \"in photos too?\", \"expenses too?\", \"what about Roof?\"], [\"Could you find anything to do with Passport, please?\", \"Would you mind showing me only the photo ones?\", \"Could you tell me whether it appears in my photos as well?\", \"And is it in my expenses as well, please?\", \"What about Roof, please?\"], [\"find anything w passport\", \"just the pics pls\", \"is it in my photos too\", \"and in expenses?\", \"what about roof\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w09-077\", \"v\": [[\"Could you show me what's in my Ideas notebook, please?\", \"On a different note, would you tell me what the weather will be like tomorrow?\", \"Actually, never mind, thank you.\"], [\"whats in my ideas notebook\", \"also whats the weather tmrw\", \"nvm forget it\"], [\"What's in the Ideas notebook?\", \"What will the weather be tomorrow?\", \"Never mind, scratch that.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w10-000\", \"v\": [[\"What's Saskia Larkin's phone number?\", \"What haven't I done yet?\", \"Which ones are due this week?\"], [\"umm could you g